{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1473818-duration-of-discipline-powers","id":1473818,"title":"Duration of Discipline Powers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-02-02T05:51:15-08:00","id":1473818,"title":"Duration of Discipline Powers","content":"Maybe I'm blind, but I can't find an default duration for discipline powers in V20.<br /> <br /> I'm talking about Serpentis 3 or Viscitude 4, they have a vitae cost, but there is duration given.<br /> <br /> Second question:<br /> Serpentis 4 - can I talk in serpent shape? Because I <u><b>can</b></u> use dominate^^<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>V20 p. 210</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">[...]The character may use any Disciplines while in this form save those that require hands (such as Feral Claws).</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27259-j4nu5","name":"J4NU5","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-02T08:44:30-08:00","id":1473831,"title":"","content":"In games I run, if a shape-changing discipline doesn't list a duration in the rules, then it lasts until voluntarily ended by the user. I can, however, see an argument for having the effect end at dawn, as Serpentis 4 does.<br /> As for Dominate use, it is possible to issue simple commands without speaking - see V20, p151 - &quot;Further, commands must be issued verbally, although simple orders may be made with signs \u2014 for example, a pointed finger and forceful expression to indicate \u201cGo!\u201d However, the subject won\u2019t comply if he can\u2019t understand the vampire, no matter how powerful the Kindred\u2019s will is.&quot;<br /> Snakes can't talk, so I would say a vampire that has taken on the form of a snake cannot talk either. Much as I would argue that Gangrel that have become bats and wolves cannot talk. But that doesn't mean that a talented user of Dominate could not acheive eye contact and make their intention very clear whilst in the form of an animal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":699,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/699-malleusxxiii","user":"MalleusXXIII","date":". 02-02-2022, 12:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/699-malleusxxiii","name":"MalleusXXIII","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar699_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-02T08:47:41-08:00","id":1473833,"title":"","content":"If it's a &quot;scene&quot; then it's like, 3-15 minutes, it's really a &quot;sounds right&quot; kinda thing.<br /> <br /> Vicissitude 4 should last till undone, part of Visc's deal is that it's long lasting. Obtenebration 5 should last too.<br /> Serpentis? Up to you. Protean's whole thing was how temporary it was though.<br /> <br /> <br /> Dominate can be used with gestures. A snake can gesture with it's tail... If it can be understood, it can work. There's also an obfuscate+Dominate power that allows you to speak telepathically to Dominate (eye contact still needed)<br /> <br /> Protean 4 not allowing Dominate or thaumaturgy is really just arbitration that isn't needed. However, I do lament that there's no clear ruling on whether I can still use animalism while riding another animal (and thus jump between animals)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 02-02-2022, 11:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}